# Slice 2 · Complete Demo Dataset + Ask My Company + Draft Reply

*Fill 12 missing demo docs · add /app/ask mock · add Draft Reply panel · still no backend*

---

## Why

Slice-1 ships 4 docs and shows organize+approve. The blueprint demo (control pack §23.3) calls for 16 docs and three product moments: organize, *ask*, *draft*. Without /app/ask and Draft Reply, the demo's promise ("AI prepares replies, AI answers from your docs") is not visible. This slice closes that gap with mocks — convincing enough for SME pilot conversations, no real RAG yet.

---

## Scope

```
IN     12 new synthetic docs · Romanian content + extraction object per doc
       /app/ask  Ask My Company chat mock · canned Q&A + honest "not found" fallback
       Draft Reply panel inside doc detail · pre-canned Romanian replies for client requests
       new data files: src/lib/data/qa.ts · src/lib/data/replies.ts
       inbox.ts grows to 16 docs (split into per-type sections within file is fine)
       sidebar nav updated: Inbox · Ask My Company

OUT    real RAG · embeddings · vector search
       file upload · backend · auth
       PDF parsing · OCR
       editing replies (Approve / Edit-locally / Discard is enough for now)
       sending replies (no auto-send · ever)
```

---

## Acceptance

```
inbox          16 cards · all 4 types (invoice · contract · client request · supplier offer · accountant · HR · procedure · price list)
               filter by type works · urgency sort works
ask            8 §23.3 example questions return canned answers citing source filenames
               unknown question → "Information not found in your documents" + suggestion to upload more
draft          3 client_request docs render Draft Reply panel with Romanian draft
               Approve marks draft as approved (state visible) · audit event logged
               no Send button visible anywhere
walkthrough    still under 3 min for stranger first-pass
               product promise visible: organize · ask · draft · approve
```

---

